          </p>

          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/services/seo" class="primary-btn">SEO Services</a>
            <a href="/services/ai-search" class="secondary-btn">AI Search Help</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <h2>Services</h2>

          <div class="service-grid">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>SEO Strategy</h3>
              <p>
                Technical SEO, on-page optimization, keyword research,
                content planning, internal linking, migrations, and
                long-term organic growth strategies.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>AI Search Visibility</h3>
              <p>
                Improve visibility across ChatGPT, Perplexity,
                Gemini, Claude, AI Overviews, and emerging AI-driven
                search experiences.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>Local SEO</h3>
              <p>
                Google Business Profile optimization, local landing
                pages, citation cleanup, review strategies, and map
                visibility improvements.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>Content Strategy</h3>
              <p>
                Build useful, search-friendly content that answers
                real questions and helps users discover your business
                earlier in the customer journey.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>About Mitchell Haw</h2>

          <p>
            I work in organic search strategy with a focus on SEO,
            AI search visibility, local search, content structure,
            and digital discoverability.
          </p>

          <p>
            Over the years, I have worked across large multi-location
            websites, tourism brands, local businesses, and content-driven
            platforms. My approach combines technical SEO foundations,
            strong content strategy, local visibility, and emerging
            AI search optimization.
          </p>

          <p>
            Based in Bend, Oregon, I also build and manage local web
            properties focused on travel, outdoor recreation, and
            community-driven content.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>Looking for SEO or AI Search Help?</h2>

          <p>
            Whether you need help improving rankings, preparing for
            AI-driven search, organizing site architecture, or growing
            local visibility, feel free to reach out.
          </p>

          <a href="mailto:hello@example.com" class="primary-btn">
            Contact Me
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
